000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          SIRMULT.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        8/20/90.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700 INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800 SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.     MULTIPLE ITEM ISSUE AND RETURN WITHOUT WORKSHEET.
001000*
001100*    THIS PROGRAM ISSUES MULTIPLE ITEMS FROM THE STOREROOM, IN
001200*    SIMILAR FORMAT TO THE STOREROOM WORKSHEET, BUT THE ITEMS
001300*    ARE WITHDRAWN IMMEDIATELY, WITHOUT THE NEED FOR PROCESSING
001400*    THE WORKSHEET.
001500*
      *C    03/07/94   JEFF BUNGO
      *C        FOR CRAFTSMAN SIGNON ("CFA, CFB, ETC) IN MULTI
      *C        STOREROOM, USE THE THIRD CHARACTER AS DEFAULT
      *C        STORERROOM.
      *C        IF MULTIPLE STOREROOM, USER-1-6 NOT "STORES", AND
      *C        MULTI-INSTEAD-RW = "Y" THEN IF USER-1-2 = "CF" THEN
      *C        DEFAULT STOREROOM = USER-3.
      *C   04NOV1994    WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST 94-027
      *C     ADDED CODE TO PASS NEW PARMS TO TQTYEDIT, TO CHECK FOR LIMITS
      *C     ON STOREROOM RETURNS.
      *C
      *C   06/12/96    JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     INCLUDE CENTURY FOR ACTIVITY AND LAST ISSUE DATE.
      *C
      *C   05/06/97    JEFF BUNGO
      *C     PASS NEW PARAMETERS TO TQTYEDIT TO FORCE WITHDRAWAL
      *C     FROM GOODYEAR BINS FIRST BEFORE FRANCHISE BINS FOR
      *C     CODES THAT ARE FRANCHISED OWNED.  ALSO CREATE A
      *C     TC333 OR TC433 FOR EACH OWNER THE WITHDRAWAL IS
      *C     MADE FROM.
018200*C
      *C   OCTOBER 1995  JIM COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED ISSPARTS PARAMETERS TO BE INCLUDED IN A COPYLIB
      *C     MEMBER. THIS WAS NECESSARY TO ALLOW THE AREA TO BE
      *C     EXPANDABLE TO CONTAIN THE LINK TO A WORK ORDER LOGIC
      *C     REQUEST NOW AVAILABLE IN AN E1 REQUISITION CREATE.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 22, 1998  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED CALL TO MCXSNDMSG TO SEND A MESSAGE TO USERS
      *C     SPECIFIED IN MCFPCSUSER FILE WHEN A PARTICULAR CODE
      *C     IS WITHDRAWN FROM THE STOREROOM.
      *C
001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002000 COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002100
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDAILYTC-DT-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USER-I
               ASSIGN         TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSER
               ORGANIZATION   IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE    IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY     IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                              WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS    IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCSTR-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
002300
