010000*------ PARMS FOR CALL TO 'TQTYEDIT'
      *-----05/06/97 JSB, CHANGE BIN AREA TO PASS TO TQTYEDIT
       01  BIN-AREA.
           05  SAVE-LINE OCCURS 6 TIMES.
               10  DE-FRAN               PIC X(4).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(20).
               10  DE-QTY-X              PIC X(8).
               10  DE-QTY-9 REDEFINES DE-QTY-X PIC 9(8).
010200 01  RET-SUB                       PIC 9(1).
       01  WARNING-FLAG                  PIC X(01) VALUE "N".
       01  WARNING-TYPE                  PIC X(01) VALUE " ".
       01  WARNING-VALUE                 PIC 9(08) VALUE 0.
      *---5/6/97, JSB HOLDING AREA FOR FRANCHISERS
       01  FRAN-TABLE.
           05  FRAN-ENTRY OCCURS 4 TIMES INDEXED BY FRAN-IDX.
               10  FRAN-ID             PIC X(1).
               10  FRAN-NAME           PIC X(4).
               10  FRAN-VEN0CODE       PIC X(10).
       01  FRAN-SUB                    PIC 9.

      *----5/6/97, HOLDING AREA FOR ISSUE FROM EACH BIN OWNER.
       01  OWNER-TABLE.
          05  OWNER-ENTRY OCCURS 6 TIMES INDEXED BY OWNR-IDX.
              10  OWNR                PIC X(4).
              10  OWNR-QTY            PIC 9(9).
       01  CURR-OWNR                  PIC 9(1).
       01  MAX-OWNRS                  PIC 9(1).
       01  HOLD-FRAN-ID               PIC X(1).

      *----------- MESSAGE PARAMETER FOR CALL TO MCXSNDMSG.
       01  MCXSNDMSG-PARM.
           05  MCXSNDMSG-CODE            PIC X(08).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X.
           05  MCXSNDMSG-MSG             PIC X(70).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(433).
