047300     MOVE EDIT-REQ-DEPT            TO  HOLD-REQ-DEPT.
047400     MOVE EDIT-CHARGE-DEPT         TO  HOLD-CHARGE-DEPT.
047500     MOVE EDIT-EXP-CLASS           TO  HOLD-EXP-CLASS.
047600
047700     IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
047800         GO TO 7990-EC-X.
