048600*------ EDIT QTY IN SINGLE QTY/ DON'T UPDATE MODE
048700     IF SCOM-PGM-KEY = "SW6"
048800         MOVE "I4"                 TO  RET-CODE
048900     ELSE
049000         MOVE "R4"                 TO  RET-CODE.
049100     MOVE DE-STOREROOM             TO  MULT-STR-STR.
      *------5/6/97 INIT BIN-AREA WITH FRANCHISE FOR BINS
           PERFORM VARYING FRAN-SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL FRAN-SUB > 6
               IF FRAN-TABLE = SPACES
                   MOVE SPACES TO DE-FRAN(FRAN-SUB)
               ELSE
                   SET FRAN-IDX TO 1
                   SEARCH FRAN-ENTRY
                     AT END  MOVE SPACES TO DE-FRAN (FRAN-SUB)
                     WHEN FRAN-ID(FRAN-IDX) = STR-BIN-OWNER (FRAN-SUB)
                      MOVE FRAN-NAME(FRAN-IDX) TO DE-FRAN(FRAN-SUB)
                   END-SEARCH
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
