      *----------GOODYEAR OWNED USES AVG COST
      *----------FRANCHISE OWNED USES MKT COST
               IF STR-CODE-OWNER NOT = SPACES
                 IF HOLD-FRAN-ID NOT = STR-CODE-OWNER
060300             MOVE STR-AVG-COST     TO  TC333-AVG-COST
                 ELSE
                   MOVE STR-MKT-COST     TO  TC333-AVG-COST
                 END-IF
               ELSE
                 MOVE STR-AVG-COST       TO  TC333-AVG-COST
               END-IF
